# Legal & product copy

Follow `docs/architecture/LEGAL_REQUIREMENTS.md`.

- Never claim Helvety can read, decrypt, or recover vault content.
- Always state that lost passkeys/recovery keys mean permanent data loss when discussing unlock.
- Do not invent certifications, compliance badges, or “military-grade” fluff.
- Distinguish account data (email, billing metadata) from vault ciphertext.
- Final ToS/Privacy/AUP text requires Swiss counsel — mark drafts as needing review.
- No public signup/billing UI without acceptance gates for ToS, Privacy, AUP, E2EE ack.
